gate: OPEN
v:4 role:dev x:frontend
task: S90 T1 — Unit tests for pure lib modules
requires: [FRONTEND_DEV]
sprint: S90

context: |
  Colocate *.test.ts next to the module, as config-app does for
  src/lib. No React render. No network.

steps:
  1. Cover src/lib modules that return data: datetime, utils, sorting,
     vehicle-telemetry, vehicle-name, track-ew-filter, map-bearing,
     format-header-date-span, screen-date-range-init, settings-sound-map,
     api-throttler.
  2. Cover features that are pure: report-column-keys,
     report-table-model, humanize-report-column-key, popup-telemetry,
     popup-fuel parsers and formatters, popup-ignition, popup-address,
     date-range-picker/lib/utils.
  3. Each test names the input and the returned value. Skip modules that
     only re-export.

out:
  - src/lib/*.test.ts
  - src/features/**/*.test.ts for the pure files above

done:
  - pnpm test includes these files and exits 0.
  - No test starts a dev server or reads a live vehicle.
